OL,5,G2000 Corsica: Jewel of the Med
OL,6,     F'The island of beauty' boasts 600
OL,7,     Fmiles of coast, lush forests, and
OL,8,     Fmountains. In Bastia, Canistrelli
OL,9,     Fbiscuits draw in crowds, while
OL,10,     FNapoleon's statue is restored in
OL,11,     FAjaccio.
OL,12,G2100 Alexander Armstrong in South Korea
OL,13,     FAlexander explores the incredible
OL,14,     Fhistory and culture of a country
OL,15,     Fthat's smaller than England but
OL,16,     Ffull of fascinating features, from
OL,17,     FK-Pop to a profound ritual of
OL,18,     Fdeath and rebirth.
